# FWAIT/WAIT with no coprocessor attached: nothing to wait for, so it retires
# like NOP. With CR0.TS and CR0.MP both set the 386 raises #NM (device not
# available); that exception is not modelled yet, so the step stops instead.
read_msw status
bit ts status 3
bit mp status 1
and both ts mp
not clear both
require clear
preserve_flags all
retire
